    "expectedRule": "Chapter 9 keeps causal debt 0-4. The first clear of a monster or trap (not the zero_sum_auditor boss) opens a pending ledger for that node; while it is pending, leaving is blocked with `因果账本尚未结算，请先选择平衡、透支或偿还。`. law/resolve-causal-ledger settles it: balance leaves debt alone, overdraw adds 1 debt and heals, repay removes 1 debt and costs max(1, floor(maxHp x 15%)) HP; max HP is derived from the build (the decoder recomputes it, so no HP is given as input): 50 + 14 x body 30 + patched_coat 10 = 480, so repay costs 72; repay with no debt is refused with `当前没有可偿还的因果债。`. Display: title 因果账本, status `因果债 n/4，账目已结`, `因果债 n/4，待平账` or, while the boss holds seals, `因果债 n/4，追缴印 k`; severity danger while collecting or at 4, warning while pending or in debt, resolved at 0 with nothing pending (targetReached). Gates open at debt at most: causal_verdict_bridge (verdict_bridge -> zero_sum_auditor) 2, causal_north_verdict_lock 1, causal_east_verdict_lock 3, and while closed read `因果债需降至 n 或以下；在待平账中选择偿还以降债。`. Selecting the boss locks the debt and mints collection seals equal to it (no echo_breaker_gauntlets here); the first damaging attack on the boss spends one seal. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
